    "messages": [
      {
        "message_id": 1,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Hello Cedar Cart Team\nGreetings of the day!",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 2,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Several important on-page SEO problems emerged from my review of your website. On the homepage, both the meta title and description are too long; it also contains multiple H1 tags and an improper heading structure, while many images lack ALT attributes. Addressing these findings should improve the website's SEO performance, crawlability, and search visibility.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 3,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "The current figures—around 145 monthly visits and an Authority Score of 27—show that the website receives very low organic traffic and has low authority, leaving significant room for improvement. We can raise organic traffic and search rankings with the right SEO strategy, quality link building, and on-page optimization.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 4,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "From my previous client work, please review the SEO results as well.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 5,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "agency",
        "text": "Attached is the audit report I prepared on the website’s major fixes; please review it. Once the job starts, I will perform a deeper analysis to identify all issues and produce a comprehensive audit report.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 6,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "agency",
        "text": "Greetings of the day, Cedar Cart Team!\n\nI'm following up on the website audit report I previously shared. For every day the website remains less than fully optimized, another opportunity to attract potential customers through Google is missed.\n\nBy applying the right on-page SEO improvements and link-building strategy, I can increase your organic traffic and strengthen your online presence. If you're interested, I can also send a customized SEO strategy covering the priority fixes, the implementation process, and the expected results.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 7,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "agency",
        "text": "Several growth opportunities for your business stand out. Search-engine visibility is currently being restricted by the website's limited keyword rankings, weak backlink profile, and low organic traffic.\n\nThe brand also has little to no presence on emerging AI search and answer platforms, including ChatGPT, Google AI Mode, AI Overviews, Gemini, Claude, and Perplexity, where millions of users now discover and evaluate businesses. Improving both SEO and AI visibility can significantly expand your online reach, generate more qualified leads, and build long-term brand authority.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 8,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "For SEO blog content, guest posts, on-page SEO, and off-page SEO, could you put together a plan?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 9,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "agency",
        "text": "I'll prepare a plan for you. Should it be one collective plan covering complete SEO, blogs, and guest posts? Please confirm.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 10,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "agency",
        "text": "Because the individual services each have specific prices, purchasing them separately tends to cost more; the collective plan should therefore be a little more cost-friendly.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 11,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Per week, what does the collective plan cost?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 12,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "From your list, could I select the Guest post option?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 13,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "agency",
        "text": "You can review the document and choose whichever option suits you best. I have prepared it with the different available plans.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 14,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "agency",
        "text": "Guest posting is included in the SEO plan too, yes.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 15,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Where can I access the plan document to review it?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 16,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "agency",
        "text": "For your concern, the attached Collective SEO plans are available; please review them.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 17,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "agency",
        "text": "The attachment is available below; please review it.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 18,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "The plan I need should cover only SEO blogs, guest posts, on-page SEO, and off-page SEO.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 19,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "agency",
        "text": "The plan shared above already covers on-page SEO, off-page SEO, blogs, and guest posts. In addition, I included all the points I will work on.",
        "milestone": null
      }
